# Optional — NOT required for a standard Battle.net Steam shortcut.
# Copy to /usr/local/etc/wow-forever.env on the guest (Launch-BattleNet.sh loads it if present).
# Filename is historical; used for Retail, Classic, and Forever.
#
# === Configure in DroidDeck / Steam ===
#   Target: Battle.net Launcher.exe  (not Battle.net.exe alone)
#   Compatibility: DroidDeck-Proton 11-9.1 ARM64EC WoW
#   Launch without Steam: launch options empty or %command% only
#   Steam UI launch: /usr/local/bin/Launch-BattleNet.sh %command%
#   Session: Linux Vulkan driver (Turnip / Mesa A8xx — not a mismatched global driver)
#
# Battle.net → pick Retail / Classic / Forever → gear → Game Settings →
# Additional command line arguments: -d3d11  (set on each product you play)
#
# === Typical path overrides ===
# BNET_APPID=4153382437
# WOW_ROOT=/root/Storage/Game
# BNET_DIR=/root/Storage/Battle.net
#
# === FEX (only if Battle.net fails without them) ===
# FEX_APP_DATA_LOCATION=/run/droiddeck/fex-4153382437/
# FEX_BNET_FORCE_X86=1
# FEX_DYNAMICL1CACHE=0
#
# WOW_LOGDIR=/tmp/wow-launch-4153382437
